2:T464,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BlogPosting","@id":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/best-male-voiceover#blogposting","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/best-male-voiceover","headline":"Best Male Voiceover","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/best-male-voiceover","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Guy Harris","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/voiceoverguy","image":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/assets/images/guy-harris-profile.jpg"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"VoiceoverGuy","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/assets/images/guy-harris-voiceover.png"}},"inLanguage":"en-GB","isAccessibleForFree":true,"description":"Award-winning British male voiceover by Guy Harris. Trusted by brands like Disney, Apple and ITV. Listen to demos across radio, TV, apps and trailers.","datePublished":"2014-06-01T00:00:00+00:00","dateModified":"2014-06-01T00:00:00+00:00","keywords":["award winner winning"],"image":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/assets/img/blog/best-male-voiceover.jpg"}}6:["slug","best-male-voiceover","d"]
0:["PTF5f6zbP51hXl6zOpnuH",[[["",{"children":[["slug","best-male-voiceover","d"],{"children":["__PAGE__?{\"slug\":\"best-male-voiceover\"}",{}]}]},"$undefined","$undefined",true],["",{"children":[["slug","best-male-voiceover","d"],{"children":["__PAGE__",{},[["$L1",[[["$","script","schema-0",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$2"}}],["$","script","schema-1",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"@id\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/best-male-voiceover#breadcrumb\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"News & Blog\",\"item\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/voiceover-news\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Best Male Voiceover\",\"item\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/best-male-voiceover\"}]}"}}]],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","h1",null,{"children":"Best Male Voiceover"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-sub","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>Nominated for the VOX Awards 2014 and won Best male voiceover. </p>"}}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-post-body","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-main one-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<br><h2>Award winning voice</h2>\r\n<p>Amazing! Last time I won was 2011. I won with a promo I voiced for Sport Relief on BBC Radio 1. The VOX Awards are recognised in our industry and have been running for 20 years. The competition is organised by <a title=\"Voiceovers.co.uk\" href=\"https://www.voiceovers.co.uk\" target=\"_blank\">Voiceovers.co.uk</a> and I follow it every year, so I'm so pleased that they've given me the award for Best Male Voiceover this year! I think any voiceover artist gets work off the back of their portfolio, but it always helps to be recognised by the most prestigious awards! </p>"}}],false,false]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-section two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/best-male-voiceover.jpg","alt":"Best Male Voiceover","className":"blog-post-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>A Little Information about the VOX Awards</h2>\r\n<p>The VOX Awards run every year, and they're usually held in October. What makes the  VOX Awards so special is that they focus on voiceover, celebrating and focusing on the industry's various different areas. Here's a rough, but not exhaustive list of the awards: <br>\r\n- Best Male Voiceover Performance <br>\r\n- Best Female Voiceover Performance <br>\r\n- Best Use of Humour <br>\r\n- Best Character Performance <br>\r\n- Best Use of Music <br>\r\n- Best Visual Advertising Campaign</p>\r\n"}}]]}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"blog-post-section ","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>A Little More about Voiceover Awards</h2>\r\n<p>As I said before, it's mainly a voiceover artist's showreels that secure most of our work. It's my numerous <a href=\"/santa-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Santa Voiceover\">Santa voiceover jobs</a>, for example, that ensure I get asked to do more work the following Christmas! And it's my extensive experience with <a href=\"/explainer-video-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Explainer Video Voiceover\">explainer videos</a> that have encouraged new clients to get in touch. However, the awards can help some us shine a little brighter than the others and it's always great to be recognised by my peers. I have won 3 VOX Awards in the past and I've even been a finalist on three different occasions for the larger SOVAS (the Voice Arts Awards in Hollywood)."}}],null]}]],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-bottom-text","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Get in touch</h2>\r\n<p>Are you looking for a voice over for your next big <a href=\"/commercial-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">advertisement</a>? One with credibility and experience? One with all kinds of impressive VOX Awards to their name? Please feel free to fill in the form and get in touch. I'd be very happy to send a sample of your script before you book me. Simply send a few lines of the script first so you can be sure I'm right for your brand. I make the whole process as easy as possible with 99% of the jobs delivered the same day.</p>"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-cta","children":["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/voiceover-news","className":"cta-btn cta-btn--outline","children":"← Back to News & Blog"}]}],["$","$L4",null,{"pageTitle":"Best Male Voiceover","pageUrl":"best-male-voiceover"}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-related-strip","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-grid","children":[["$","$L3","922",{"href":"/boom-beach-hammerman-hot-tub-voice","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/boom-beach-hammerman-hot-tub-voice.jpg","alt":"boom-beach-hammerman-hot-tub-voice","className":"blog-related-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-title","children":"Boom Beach Hammerman's hot tub"}]]}],["$","$L3","564",{"href":"/kings-road-voiceover","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/kings-road-voiceover.jpg","alt":"Kings Road Voiceover","className":"blog-related-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-title","children":"Kings Road Voiceover"}]]}],["$","